An alert for the rule rule-1 in the uploaded SARIF file contained 11 thread flows which is more than our limit of 10. Only 10 were stored and the additional ones were ignored.

Report the issue in the [CodeQL repository](https://github.com/github/codeql/issues).

[Learn more about limits in SARIF uploads](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/code-scanning/integrating-with-code-scanning/sarif-support-for-code-scanning#validating-your-sarif-file).
